{"id":397,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"They form remarkably large flocks and are constantly fighting amongst themselves. I suspect that those with magnificent plumes on their heads are the strong ones."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","Pearl"],"text":"It lives in forests and fields. Squabbles over territory occur when flocks collide."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"They maintain huge flocks, although fierce scuffles break out between various flocks."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"Recognizing their own weakness, they always live in a group. When alone, a Staravia cries noisily."},{"games":["Diamond"],"text":"It flies around forests and fields in search of bug Pokémon. It stays within a huge flock."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Intimidate","hidden":false,"description":"When the Pokémon enters a battle, it intimidates opposing Pokémon and makes them cower, lowering their Attack stats."},{"name":"Reckless","hidden":true,"description":"Powers up moves that have recoil damage."}],"eggGroups":["Flying"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Brown","shape":"Wings","evolution":{"id":396,"name":"Starly","condition":null,"children":[{"id":397,"name":"Staravia","condition":"Lv. 14","children":[{"id":398,"name":"Staraptor","condition":"Lv. 34","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,45],[1,98],[9,17],[13,104],[18,283],[23,18],[28,332],[33,36],[38,97],[43,413],[48,515]],"machine":[512,332,97,314,403,413,38,814,283,203,263,297,19,257,270,542,182,240,156,214,164,241,129,366,36,851,168,369,253],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me2pt5-169","name":"Larry's Staravia","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"169","artist":"Fujimoto Gold","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-169/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-169/large"},{"id":"sv1-149